---
---
<section class="bg-dark-background py-20" data-ps="security-services-pa/SecurityServicesHero.astro">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
      <span class="status-dot">[ Founded August 1990 — Under New Ownership Since 2016 ]</span>
    </div>
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
      <div>
        <h1
          class="font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-dark-foreground mb-6"
          style="font-size: var(--text-h1); line-height: 1.05;"
        >
          About KRE Security
        </h1>
        <p class="text-dark-muted-foreground text-base leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-lg">
          KRE Security LLC. was founded in August of 1990. We are a full-time Security Service and Investigations Corporation. We provide factually based investigations and conduct every investigation ethically, morally, legally and with the highest degree of integrity.
        </p>
        <p class="text-dark-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-lg">
          Our goal is to meet your security needs 24/7 while providing cost effective services to our customers.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="inline-block bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm px-8 py-4 border-2 border-primary hover:bg-primary-hover transition-colors duration-150"
          >
            Contact Us: 610-562-0971
          </a>
          <a
            href="/security-company-faq"
            class="inline-block bg-transparent text-dark-foreground font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm px-8 py-4 border-2 border-dark-border hover:border-primary hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-150"
          >
            Learn More: FAQs
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="tactical-frame bg-dark-border/20 p-6 border border-dark-border">
          <p class="text-primary font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-2">
            [ Featured Press ]
          </p>
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold uppercase text-dark-foreground text-base mb-2">
            "Post-9/11, A New World Emerges for Security"
          </h3>
          <p class="text-dark-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">
            An article written by Reading Eagle's Carole Duran — read about the difference KRE Security LLC. is making in the community when it comes to safety and security.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="tactical-frame overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/d22f750a/images/39725c_4a7648f40324491e9b8364d7b4789a69~mv2-320.webp"
            alt="KRE Security affiliations"
            class="w-full max-w-[320px] h-auto object-contain bg-background p-4"
            loading="eager"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
